+            // arcint M9 (patches/0005, P1). A device-resident MoE expert
+            // slot buffer is a reinterpret_buffer of a smaller physical
+            // allocation onto the full constant layout, so _bytes_count here
+            // is the full constant size; the bounce-copy below would
